 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Wotaku ni Koi wa Muzukashii Comic Anthology"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ヲタクに恋は難しい コミックアンソロジー"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Wotaku ni Koi wa Muzukashii Comic Anthology"
   },
   {
    "en": "Love Is Hard for Otaku Comic Anthology"
   },
   {
    "en": "Wotakoi: Love Is Hard for Otaku Comic Anthology"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Minekura Kazuya ([Saiyuki](https://mangadex.org/title/cc8643f2-5ede-4b0a-9bcd-8994a201b45b/)), Azusa Kina ([After School at the Coffee Shop](https://mangadex.org/title/eab8c668-0030-413d-97f9-c6f0cae8ed42/)), Namori ([YuruYuri](https://mangadex.org/title/6306c976-d776-48c3-b29f-d345e65f272b)), etc... A splendid writing team participates!\nThe official comic anthology of the popular manga [Wotakoi: Love Is Hard for Otaku](https://mangadex.org/title/65263bf9-4f87-4513-b72f-ad6436b3911c), which has sold a total of over 9 million copies (including digital editions)!\n\n---\n\nContributors:\nCover: Fujita\nIllustrations: Akiyoshi Shima, Sachiko, Namori, Haida Nanako\nManga: \n1. Azusa Kina\n2. Konno Paru\n3. Hachiya Kujira\n4. Shiromanta\n5. Yamaguchi Eito\n6. Dorokawa Megumi\n7. Kakitsubata Waka\n8. Nagao Uka\n9. Anno\n10. Tachi Aoi\n11. Medamayaki\n12. Nouichi Nye\n13. Minami Kiri\n14. Megane\n15. Asahi Noboru\n16. Minekura Kazuya",
   "ja": "『最遊記』峰倉かずや、『放課後は喫茶店で』あずさきな、『ゆるゆり』なもり etc…豪華執筆陣が参加！！　累計900万部突破(電子含む)の大人気コミック、『ヲタクに恋は難しい』の公式コミックアンソロジー！\n【執筆作家陣】カバー：ふじた　イラスト：秋吉しま/幸子/なもり/灰田ナナコ　マンガ：朝陽昇/あずさきな/杏乃/杜若わか/紺野ぱる/しろまんた/立葵/泥川恵/永緒ウカ/能一ニェ/鉢谷くじら/南きり/峰倉かずや/めがね/目玉焼き/山口えいと"
  },
